        E.form F.form E.gamma F.gamma m M ⟨GE jQ om f, hu⟩ c
        (centeredCube (aux_thm_prop_mass_center g.H1 g.Mm sigma n k)
          (aux_thm_prop_mass_side g.H1 n) (aux_thm_prop_grid_side_pos g.H1 n) :
